{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108078","id":2626062180,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6chodk","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108078","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108078.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108078.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108078","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108078/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108078/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108078/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e7d5fd7dc31f8fe9f0a4f323a60a3169f3b984c7","number":108078,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Allow TabBar's navigation buttons to switch tabs instead of scrolling","user":{"login":"Nikitf777","id":127026067,"node_id":"U_kgDOB5JDkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127026067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777","html_url":"https://github.com/Nikitf777","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR allows to use TabBar's navigation buttons to switch tabs instead of just scrolling through them. This is especially useful on mobile where it's not very convinient to stretch your fingers to the top of the screen. But with this feature, you can use your right hand to comfortable access all the tabs.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2ffee63b-25db-4f4c-b306-b14054ac9077\r\n\r\nTo achieve this, the PR introduces two new flags:\r\n* `navigation_buttons_switch_tabs` [default: false]\r\n* `navigation_buttons_always_visible` [default: false]\r\nThe second one is needed because if you want to use navigation buttons to switch tabs, you most likely want them to always be visible.\r\nAs the video shows, the flags can be changed in runtime just fine. But it triggers `queue_redraw`, so changing them too often can be performance-heavy.\r\nAlso, I like this behavior even more than the default one and would like to make it default. But I decided not to do this to avoid breaking compatibility at all.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar